Package: glass.sqdaitools
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Downloading and Processing GLASS Land Surface Products
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Shaoqing", family = "Dai",
    email = "dsq1993qingge@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0858-4728"))
Description: Queries, downloads and post-processes products from the GLASS
    (Global Land Surface Satellite) data archive at glass.hku.hk. Provides a
    product registry with archive path templates and band metadata, mapping
    of regions of interest onto the MODIS sinusoidal (h/v) tile grid of the
    archive, composite DOY lookup for date ranges, a batch download engine
    (built on 'httr2', with size verification, resume and retry), and
    'terra'-based post-processing including fill values, reprojection,
    multi-tile mosaics and temporal composites. Also ships an optional
    interactive 'shiny'/'leaflet' download interface.
